{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0543_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e7e7cd71c938b3a9a84265565513651356cdbeb7d27de47dc663597b544c1a46", "ja": "（JCCのイベントに向けて、毎日大忙しだ。\n今日は溜まっていた事務作業を片付けよう……）", "zh": "（为了JCC的活动，每天都忙得不可开交。\n今天先把积压的文书工作处理掉吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0543_1002_se", "source_sha256": "e32ad030111556f371b23fdebe8dbbc12a1aa8899f107a10cbf3e89701e39eb1", "ja": "カタカタカタッ、カタカタカタッ……", "zh": "咔哒咔哒咔哒、咔哒咔哒咔哒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0543_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "20026ecf8c155d961013658b3c47f9f4fb75b62bb9182e0d605e046f3d0da596", "ja": "おお～……鮮やかなキーボードさばきですね～。\n私では、こうはいきませんよ～。", "zh": "哇～……键盘敲得真熟练呢～。\n换作是我，可做不到这样哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0543_1004_se", "source_sha256": "50e57822ca0a13f0fb0c90faa1ea526634c398e9bc02e67194426f3b3c3d619d", "ja": "カチカチ、カチ……カタカタカタ……", "zh": "咔哒、咔哒……哒哒哒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0543_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "df2749d90761fb3c626f9c101474cd55ecbeab2bf2f47fe681ea0a120f6bfa7a", "ja": "数字の入力も、とっても早いですね～。\nふむふむ……これは私たちのスケジュールですな～？", "zh": "输数字的速度也好快呢～。\n嗯嗯……这是我们的日程表吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0543_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f94b142427b6d6069a1925fbb7a1d420b05691bb5e68aa99b612942e8ce6550d", "ja": "ええと……美也。さっきから実況中継してるけど、\nこれ、何か参考になってるのか……？", "zh": "那个……美也。你从刚才开始就一直在解说，\n这对你有什么参考作用吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0543_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "8d3e53d146a2933a391a2acde32be0a2a93e3b305613a274f057cf9c72cebdde", "ja": "はい～。とっても参考になりますよ～。\nあ、でも、お仕事のお邪魔になっていますか～？", "zh": "是的～。非常有参考价值哦～。\n啊，不过是不是打扰到你的工作了～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0543_1008_p", "source_sha256": "424fad6ce2e8c19b9e398669ed694011ba08dec57f0e0a9662c05872e4988aa8", "ja": "いや、そんな事はないよ。\nただ見ているだけで、退屈じゃないのかなと思って。", "zh": "不，没那回事。只是觉得光是在旁边看着，会不会很无聊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0543_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "4f897c60aade9dc501aa80ef559d169998119b4d4a5b0a54688d6ed136e518e5", "ja": "いいえ～。とっても、楽しいですよ～。", "zh": "不是哦～非常开心的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0543_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "40aa175c8b53bcc459241d4505089144a2ffbc044f5a1d86e3513f8eb238c3cb", "ja": "こうして{$P$}さんのお仕事ぶりを、\n間近で見ることもできますし～。むふふ。", "zh": "像这样也能近距离看看{$P$}先生的工作表现～。唔呼呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0543_1011_p", "source_sha256": "78a22a848aa47405eca66838b6a362a5d67e134fff93d7f827a3fd75f4e1dc18", "ja": "それならいいんだけど。\nけど、急にどうしたんだ？", "zh": "那样就好。\n不过，你怎么突然这么问？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0543_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "a69294cd67f17f27be863bf48f7ba5459421053b5c61944090ec33a87723edf6", "ja": "おや～？　説明していませんでしたか～。\n失礼しました～。", "zh": "哎呀～？我还没解释过吗～？\n真是失礼了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0543_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "28dca77c854a2c687ebe8013105f10fd26a9aadcd7d06c0a8d062ebd9636f7a0", "ja": "実は、戦い方の参考にしようと思いまして～。", "zh": "其实，我是想着可以拿来参考一下战斗方式呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0543_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a03ac45560c87f0e8eb681103d2dcd3ba02eee82ca3a3842a6e0405543718bc5", "ja": "戦い方？", "zh": "战斗方式？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0543_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "3495761b748cc1f2c1f8bed8c52c7e23fbffda595e95d5c32a59a1fb89266e4d", "ja": "はい～。美希ちゃんは勘で、仕事でどうするべきか、\nすぐにわかってしまうんですよね～？", "zh": "是的～美希凭直觉，很快就能知道工作中该怎么做，对吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0543_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "e2e89f877ae42f3e213596ce2aa6c275248689872f3f77b8e1e7817d17a71c51", "ja": "ですが、私では美希ちゃんのように\n察することは、できそうにないので～。", "zh": "不过，我好像没办法像美希那样凭直觉察觉到该怎么做～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0543_1017_042miy", "source_sha256": "138fabf656707589df3358df248307df4c1c2aaa640c3666bcdda7cdbc2635b6", "ja": "せめてヒントを見つけて、戦法を考えようかと～。\n居飛車か、振り飛車か……。", "zh": "至少先找找提示，想想对策吧～\n是用居飞车，还是振飞车……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0543_1018_p", "source_sha256": "4806083d3497979aa653a1a8d15c4f9ea382ec7180011e60831936807106b22e", "ja": "それが、プロデューサーの観察？", "zh": "这就是制作人的观察？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0543_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "50e0b80a9833a55caa73e46757a3fe09f436dd022b8e3b67e496f8ba27a532d3", "ja": "はい～。一番身近な{$P$}さんの\nお仕事ぶりを見て、内容を知ることができれば……。", "zh": "是的～只要观察身边的{$P$}先生的工作表现，了解工作内容……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0543_1020_042miy", "source_sha256": "117b2ab77554f6673326c184d4d1fbdd3d1bb0466363020dce38867f37316860", "ja": "少なくとも、{$P$}さんのことは、\n察せるようになるかもしれないと思いまして～。", "zh": "我想这样一来，至少也能体察到\n{$P$}先生的心情了吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0543_1021_p", "source_sha256": "079fbe053f8eed494fd452b866e854b9893707459774d688d9bceb5ae0353feb", "ja": "なるほど……。俺は一例でしかないと思うけど、\nそういうインプットは大事かもな。", "zh": "原来如此……我觉得我也只是其中一个例子，不过，这样的输入或许很重要吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0543_1022_042miy", "source_sha256": "0c54dbb9025dd57c9c1c4d955deb5d9090f5abd2a6eea7fdb702036869d542a4", "ja": "ありがとうございます～。正面から、\n美希ちゃんにも褒めてもらえましたし……。", "zh": "谢谢您～而且美希也当面夸奖我了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_042miy0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_042miy0543_1023_042miy", "source_sha256": "fbde2dfa82073fe1c5d538697ac7f237e7c96d80d47ffbebf0c685b715eee2be", "ja": "なので{$P$}さんのことも、\n正々堂々と観察しますよ～。じーっ……。", "zh": "所以，我也要堂堂正正地观察{$P$}先生哦～。盯——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
